   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Write what you want in 'Prompt' and queue.\n\nTo change a picture instead: turn 'Edit an image' on, load the picture in 'Image', and say what to change (e.g. 'make it night', 'give him a red jacket', 'turn this into a watercolor painting'). The result keeps the picture's shape; Width and Height only apply to new images.\n\nTo put a particular face on the person: turn 'Change the face' on and load a clear photo of the face in 'Face photo'. It goes on the main person (the largest face); people in the background keep theirs.\n\n'Negative prompt' lists what to avoid (extra limbs and fingers, deformed faces, a fake look). For paintings, cartoons or 3D, remove those words from it first.\n\nImages are saved in outputs/comfyui/images. Queue again for new variations."
   ],
   "title": "How to use",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
